The photo, location and email are free. CrookCatcher Pro adds **break-in detection**, which also photographs someone who gets the PIN wrong and then guesses it right, plus video with sound and Google Drive backup. CrookCatcher has been on Google Play since 2014 and takes around 1.2 million intruder photos a day.

What it doesn't do: it doesn't photograph someone who enters the correct PIN on the first try, and it doesn't list the apps they opened.

